sequenceDiagram
actor User
participant Web as Rkestr Web
participant API as API
participant Auth as Authorization
participant WI as Work Item
participant CL as Classification
participant DL as Deadline / Time
participant DB as PostgreSQL
participant OUT as Outbox
participant MQ as Broker
User->>Web: Create Work Item
Web->>API: POST /api/v1/work-items
API->>Auth: Validate identity + workspace permission
Auth-->>API: Authorized
API->>WI: Create command
WI->>CL: Validate / derive classification
WI->>DL: Validate temporal semantics
WI->>DB: Persist state + audit
WI->>OUT: Persist WorkItemCreated
Note over DB,OUT: Same transaction
DB-->>WI: Commit
WI-->>API: Created
API-->>Web: 201 Created
OUT->>MQ: Publish after commit
